{"id":"conv_04061","context":"A boss announces a salary raise plan to his manager","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["hiroshi_boss","kenji_office"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"hiroshi_boss","mood":null,"en":"Kenji, got a minute? As a manager, there's something I want to tell you first.","jp":"ケンジくん、ちょっといいか。マネージャーとして、君に先に伝えておきたい話があるんだ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,4,6,16,21,22,26,49,62,81,128,175,197,295,787,997,1289,1378,2724,3678,4522,5004,5855,5988,12406,16559],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ケンジ"},{"s":"くん","w":1378},{"s":"、"},{"s":"ちょっと","w":197},{"s":"いい","w":81},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"。"},{"s":"マネージャー","w":4522},{"s":"として","w":49},{"s":"、"},{"s":"君","r":"きみ","w":175},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"先","r":"さき","w":295},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"伝え","r":"つたえ","w":2724},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"おき","w":997},{"s":"たい","w":62},{"s":"話","r":"はなし","w":128},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"ある","w":22},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"kenji_office","mood":null,"en":"Yes, sir. What is it? Is it about the recent financial report?","jp":"はい、社長。何でしょうか。最近の収支報告のことでしょうか。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,15,16,17,29,70,93,117,223,445,829,2100,2280,4438],"jpTokens":[{"s":"はい","w":2100},{"s":"、"},{"s":"社長","r":"しゃちょう","w":829},{"s":"。"},{"s":"何","r":"なに","w":70},{"s":"でしょ","w":17},{"s":"う","w":29},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"。"},{"s":"最近","r":"さいきん","w":223},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"収支","r":"しゅうし","w":4438},{"s":"報告","r":"ほうこく","w":445},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"こと","w":15},{"s":"でしょ","w":17},{"s":"う","w":29},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_boss","mood":null,"en":"Actually, starting next month we're implementing a company-wide raise. The current pay was insufficient for everyone's effort.","jp":"実はな、来月から全社員の賃金引き上げを実施する。現状の給与支給では、社員のがんばりに対して不十分だと感じていたんだ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,4,5,7,8,9,12,18,19,20,21,26,253,487,704,790,985,1115,1465,2609,2823,3345,4328,4425,4704,4999,6312,7407,7885,8506,10924,13091,17622],"jpTokens":[{"s":"実